---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-gray-900 text-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Main Footer -->
    <div class="py-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-12">
      <!-- Brand -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg">
            <span class="text-white font-display font-bold text-xl">DT</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-xl font-bold block">Desiree Tropini</span>
            <span class="text-gray-400 text-sm">Graphic Designer</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-md mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Creo identità visive uniche e memorabili per brand che vogliono distinguersi. Trasformo le tue idee in design che comunicano.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-3">
          <a href="#" class="w-10 h-10 bg-gray-800 hover:bg-primary-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center transition-colors">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
